                                                "sense_id": "3b9bb37d-913e-30f9-8019-d5009d369a63",
                                                "text": "Research is already suggesting that people find video calls \"exhausting\", because the unavoidable technological delay in a conversation is unsettling. You can't judge facial expressions, body language and responses as accurately when they are not instantaneous, even if you don't consciously realise it."
